    "## Usage Instructions - Target-Only Tracking Mode\n",
    "\n",
    "### How to Use This Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Install Dependencies**: Run the first cell to install required packages\n",
    "2. **Upload Videos**: Use the file upload cell to upload your video files (MP4, AVI, MOV, MKV)\n",
    "3. **Configure Targets**: Modify the `target_descriptions` list with descriptions of people you want to track\n",
    "4. **Adjust Settings**: Modify `MAX_FRAMES` and other settings as needed\n",
    "5. **Run Tracking**: Execute the main tracking cell\n",
    "6. **View Results**: Visualizations and analytics will be generated\n",
    "7. **Download**: Download tracked videos and analytics JSON\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🎯 Target-Only Tracking Mode\n",
    "\n",
    "**NEW FEATURE**: This system now operates in **Target-Only Tracking Mode**, which means:\n",
    "\n",
    "- ✅ **Only creates tracks for people who match your text descriptions**\n",
    "- ✅ **Each matched person gets a separate unique ID** \n",
    "- ✅ **Ignores all other people in the scene**\n",
    "- ✅ **Efficient processing by filtering detections early**\n",
    "- ✅ **Clear separation between different target individuals**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### How It Works:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Detection**: YOLO detects all people in each frame\n",
    "2. **CLIP Filtering**: Each detection is compared against your target descriptions\n",
    "3. **Selective Tracking**: Only detections that match descriptions get tracked\n",
    "4. **Unique IDs**: Each matched person gets assigned a separate target ID\n",
    "5. **Cross-Camera**: Same person is tracked consistently across multiple cameras\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Benefits:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Focused Results**: Only see tracking for people you care about\n",
    "- **Reduced Noise**: No tracking of irrelevant people\n",
    "- **Better Performance**: Less computational overhead\n",
    "- **Clear Analytics**: Statistics only for your targets of interest\n",
    "\n",
    "### Features\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Multi-Camera Support**: Process multiple video streams simultaneously\n",
    "- **CLIP Integration**: Natural language descriptions for target identification  \n",
    "- **ReID Enhancement**: Person re-identification across cameras and time\n",
    "- **Kalman Filtering**: Advanced motion prediction and tracking\n",
    "- **Hungarian Algorithm**: Optimal detection-to-track association\n",
    "- **Crowd Density Adaptation**: Automatic algorithm weighting based on scene complexity\n",
    "- **Target-Only Mode**: Only track people matching your descriptions\n",
    "- **Comprehensive Analytics**: Detailed performance metrics and visualizations\n",
    "\n",
    "### Target Description Examples\n",
    "\n",
    "- `\"person wearing red shirt\"`\n",
    "- `\"woman with long blonde hair\"`\n",
    "- `\"man in business suit\"`\n",
    "- `\"person carrying backpack\"`\n",
    "- `\"woman wearing glasses\"`\n",
    "- `\"tall person in dark clothing\"`\n",
    "- `\"woman wearing black skirt and bag\"`\n",
    "- `\"person in blue jacket and jeans\"`\n",
    "\n",
    "### Output Files\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Tracked Videos**: `Camera_X_tracked.mp4` with bounding boxes and IDs (only for targets)\n",
    "- **Analytics JSON**: Comprehensive tracking statistics for targets only\n",
    "- **Visualizations**: Performance plots and charts\n",
    "\n",
    "### Performance Notes\n",
    "\n",
    "- Processing time depends on video length and number of cameras\n",
    "- GPU acceleration recommended for faster processing\n",
    "- Limit `MAX_FRAMES` for testing with large videos\n",
    "- Memory usage scales with number of target matches (not total detections)\n",
    "- **Faster than before**: Target-only mode reduces computational load\n",
    "\n",
    "### Example Results Structure\n",
    "\n",
    "```json\n",
    "{\n",
    "  \"target_only_mode\": true,\n",
    "  \"global_targets\": [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "      \"target_id\": 1,\n",
    "      \"name\": \"Person_1\", \n",
    "      \"description\": \"woman wearing black skirt and bag\",\n",
    "      \"total_detections\": 45,\n",
    "      \"unique_tracks\": 3,\n",
    "      \"active_cameras\": [\"Camera_1\", \"Camera_2\"]\n",
    "    }\n",
    "  ],\n",
    "  \"per_camera_results\": {\n",
    "    \"Camera_1\": {\n",
    "      \"tracks\": [\n",
    "        {\n",
    "          \"global_target_id\": 1,\n",
    "          \"target_name\": \"Person_1\",\n",
    "          \"target_description\": \"woman wearing black skirt and bag\",\n",
    "          \"bbox\": [100, 200, 150, 400],\n",
    "          \"confidence\": 0.85\n",
    "        }\n",
    "      ],\n",
    "      \"target_tracks_only\": 1,\n",
    "      \"note\": \"Only tracking targets matching descriptions\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "  }\n",
    "}\n",
    "```"
   ]
